 202 003643  7040          CMA                     /INVERT BACK
 203 003644  3600          DCA I   WORD4           /STORE IN 8K DUMMY LINE
 204 003645  2200          ISZ     WORD4           /BUMP TO NEXT
 205 003646  5236          JMP     MOVLUP          /KEEP GOING
 206               
 207 003647  6201  MOVEND, CDF     00              /BACK TO OUR FIELD
 208 003650  3765          DCA I   (BEOFZAP)       /RESTORE BINARY LOADER
 209 003651  5765          JMP I   (BEOFZAP)       /CONTINUE IN LOADER
